:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Geomarrow ore...
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.TalkFigure",
	"ImagePath": "SpriteOutput/Mission/TalkItem/SubMIssion_2020501_03.png"
}</pre>
::'''March 7th:''' *sigh* So shiny and pretty. I picked up this little guy in Belobog's Underworld.
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.TalkFigure",
	"Show": false,
	"ImagePath": "SpriteOutput/Mission/TalkItem/SubMIssion_2020501_01.png"
}</pre>
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you sure it's not radioactive?
:::'''March 7th:''' How could something so beautiful be unsafe?
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' I can understand a young girl's fondness for glittering gemstones...
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We can't just keep lost items... Should we return it to Wildfire?
:::'''March 7th:''' They've got loads of it down there. I just chipped off a tiny piece.
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' I can understand a young girl's fondness for glittering gemstones...
::;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} A cup of Immortal's Delight...
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.TalkFigure",
	"ImagePath": "SpriteOutput/Mission/TalkItem/SubMIssion_2020501_04.png"
}</pre>
::'''Fu Xuan:''' ...
::'''March 7th:''' ...
::'''March 7th:''' One of my fondest memories on the Xianzhou!
::'''Fu Xuan:''' Hmph, no comment... I happen to prefer startaro bubble tea.
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.TalkFigure",
	"Show": false,
	"ImagePath": "SpriteOutput/Mission/TalkItem/SubMIssion_2020501_01.png"
}</pre>
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That should be enough...
::'''Fu Xuan:''' Is that it? Miss March, are you not able to provide possessions from before you lost your memory?
::'''March 7th:''' Before I lost my memory... So, something I don't remember getting? Even then, I couldn't be sure it was from before I lost my memory, right?
::'''Fu Xuan:''' It may be strange to you, but to infer the past, I need materials that were pertinent at that time. Could you try recalling some memories again?
::'''March 7th:''' From before the memory loss, before the Express...
::'''March 7th:''' I'm sorry, Master Diviner! When Himeko found me in the ice, I was stark naked &mdash; like a newborn baby. I didn't have any items with me...
::'''March 7th:''' ...and before you ask, no, I don't have any of that ice lying around.
::'''March 7th:''' It melted away not long after I was rescued.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...You sure about that, March?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...What about your Six-Phased Ice?
::'''March 7th:''' Oh yeah! (Trailblazer), you sure are a smart cookie. My Six-Phased Ice ability must date from before the memory loss. Master Diviner, any ice I create should do, right?
::'''Fu Xuan:''' It should indeed, I'll have someone place the material in the base terminal of the Matrix. Miss March, please position yourself in the Matrix core &mdash; we may begin our inference whenever you are ready.
::{{Black Screen|Moments later, the apparatuses of the Matrix come to life with clicks and whirrs. It is time.}}

