:::'''March 7th:''' Uhh, I'm pretty sure I should be, almost k&mdash;kinda ready to go...
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' Please be prepared. Not all memories are suitable for reawakening. People carry with them much pain and suffering.
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' If you're not ready, we can pause the inference process. I would never wish for good intentions to result in harm.
:::'''March 7th:''' I&mdash;I'm okay! Let's do it! Only way to find out is to give it a go!
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' Very well. I will soon connect you to the Matrix of Prescience Ultima, where the Matrix will read your memories and guide you back into your past.
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' If you reach a block in your memory, the Matrix will use the data gathered to derive a scenario, and construct a possible past for you.
:::'''March 7th:''' Got it... Oh, uh, can (Trailblazer) join me, too?
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' I'm sorry, that would be highly inadvisable. You form the nexus of the Matrix's inference &mdash; (Trailblazer) would only introduce redundant data to the system.
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' In other words, inside the memory palace that the Matrix constructs, the only person you'll be able to count on is yourself.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You can do it, March!
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...Can't say I'm filled with confidence.
::::'''March 7th:''' It's cool, I'll be fine! I'm not a little kid anymore!
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' Don't worry. I can communicate with you from outside the Matrix and manipulate the recollection process to a certain extent.
:::'''Fu Xuan:''' Let's begin.
