===Ask Fu Xuan to place March 7th into the Matrix of Prescience to recall her memories{{subst:void|<!--202050105-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Divination Commission|update|The preparations are complete. All that is left is for March 7th to connect with the Matrix of Prescience Ultima. Then, you will be able to use the Matrix of Prescience's outstanding calculation capacity to explore her past.<br />March 7th seems to be a little anxious, and you are rather worried, too. However, you are unable to go with her on this journey. You have to put your faith in Fu Xuan's skills...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
----
:'''March 7th:''' Ugh... Miss Fu Xuan, why did the simulation just cut off like that?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you okay?
::'''March 7th:''' I'm fine... Just a little light-headed is all...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What happened?
::'''March 7th:''' I don't know. Before I could figure out what was going on, it spat me out...
:'''Fu Xuan:''' ...And the Matrix of Prescience stopped at precisely the same moment!
:'''Fu Xuan:''' March, I lost sight of you once you touched that block of ice. What happened?
:'''March 7th:''' It's kinda hard to explain...
:{{Black Screen|March and Fu Xuan try their best to recount everything that just happened. You also tell them about the Messenger.}}
:'''Fu Xuan:''' So... That mysterious girl was really a messenger of the Glowswather?
:'''March 7th:''' Glowswather... you mean Fuli the Remembrance? Are they the Aeon connected to my past?
:'''Fu Xuan:''' No, it's too early to draw such a conclusion... All I can say is that it was very likely an Aeon that sealed away your memories... but not necessarily Fuli.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' When the messenger spoke of "protection," perhaps she meant the following: The Glowswather wasn't the one who sealed away your memories. THEY are interfering to shield you from these very memories.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Looks like we came away empty-handed...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds like we're still none the wiser...
:'''March 7th:''' It's not so bad... At least I know it has to do with the Garden of Recollection, right?
:'''Fu Xuan:''' It seems like retrieving memories is beyond the operational spectrum of the Matrix of Prescience Ultima.
:'''March 7th:''' That's alright! You've helped me so much already, Master Diviner. I owe you a big one.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Mm... If you'll excuse me, I must organize an inspection of the Matrix... Ugh, fingers crossed there's no damage done.
:'''March 7th:''' We'll leave you to it then! (Trailblazer), run &mdash; if we broke something there'll be a huge bill to pay!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

